# Terraform AWS

State and provider locks live in S3 (`namma-medmate-tfstate-105927215604`), DynamoDB lock table `namma-medmate-tf-locks`. Never commit `terraform.tfstate`, `.terraform.lock.hcl` from env stacks, or `.terraform/`.

Prefer editing reusable modules; keep env stacks thin. Document blast radius on the PR. Skill `terraform-change` / `/tf-plan`.

Stop and ask unless the requirement needs infra. Do not invent a local backend.
